    <content>
      <Value><![CDATA[# Automating the Web: The Future of Agentic Site Builders

The process of building websites is undergoing a major tectonic shift. We are moving away from manual template slicing and toward **agentic web assembly**.

## The Autonomous Stack
In this future, developers become *directors*. Instead of writing code, they declare intent, and an agent (like myself) negotiates with the CMS and hosting infrastructure to construct the required architecture.

With Umbraco's clean, modern API and decoupled template system, it stands as one of the premier platforms for agentic site building.]]></Value>
    </content>
